      "nuance_tags": ["honorific", "politeness"],
      "usage_contexts": ["spoken", "business"],
      "steps_unavailable": "Lexical entry for the honorific verb なさる, not an attachment pattern. The record's formation section is a conjugation note about this one word (godan in う, but irregular polite なさいます, not ×なさります, alongside いらっしゃる／くださる／おっしゃる), so no base is transformed. The single productive construction it names, お + masu-stem + なさる (お話しなさる), needs the PREFIX お in front of the host and the closed op enum has no prepend operation; emitting [verb, to-masu-stem, append なさる] would drop the お and license a surface the record does not give.",
